// 网速测试功能：用于发布管理 → 网页填表 → 网速测试。输出下载/上传速度（Mbps），并便于主进程记录日志与渲染层显示。
"use strict";

const https = require("https");

function toMbps(bytes, ms) {
  const b = Math.max(0, Number(bytes || 0) || 0);
  const t = Math.max(1, Number(ms || 0) || 1);
  return (b * 8) / t / 1000;
}

function round1(n) {
  const x = Number(n || 0);
  if (!Number.isFinite(x)) return 0;
  return Math.round(x * 10) / 10;
}

function httpsRequestRaw({ method, url, headers, body, timeoutMs }) {
  return new Promise((resolve) => {
    let done = false;
    const finish = (out) => {
      if (done) return;
      done = true;
      resolve(out);
    };
    try {
      const u = new URL(String(url || "").trim());
      const req = https.request(
        {
          protocol: u.protocol,
          hostname: u.hostname,
          port: u.port ? Number(u.port) : 443,
          path: (u.pathname || "/") + (u.search || ""),
          method: String(method || "GET").toUpperCase(),
          headers: headers && typeof headers === "object" ? headers : {}
        },
        (res) => {
          let bytes = 0;
          res.on("data", (d) => {
            bytes += Buffer.isBuffer(d) ? d.length : Buffer.byteLength(String(d));
          });
          res.on("end", () => finish({ ok: true, statusCode: Number(res.statusCode || 0) || 0, bytes }));
        }
      );
      req.on("error", () => finish({ ok: false, statusCode: 0, bytes: 0 }));
      req.setTimeout(Math.max(300, Number(timeoutMs || 0) || 15000), () => {
        try {
          req.destroy();
        } catch {}
        finish({ ok: false, statusCode: 0, bytes: 0, timeout: true });
      });
      if (body && body.length) req.write(body);
      req.end();
    } catch {
      finish({ ok: false, statusCode: 0, bytes: 0 });
    }
  });
}

async function testNetSpeed(opts) {
  const step = typeof opts?.step === "function" ? opts.step : () => {};
  const timeoutMs = Math.max(3000, Number(opts?.timeoutMs || 0) || 15000);

  const downBytes = Math.max(2_000_000, Number(opts?.downBytes || 0) || 6_000_000);
  const upBytes = Math.max(1_000_000, Number(opts?.upBytes || 0) || 2_000_000);

  const downUrl = `https://speed.cloudflare.com/__down?bytes=${encodeURIComponent(String(downBytes))}`;
  const upUrl = "https://speed.cloudflare.com/__up";

  step(`netspeed:download:start bytes=${String(downBytes)}`);
  const t1 = Date.now();
  const downRes = await httpsRequestRaw({
    method: "GET",
    url: downUrl,
    headers: { "User-Agent": "ipfactory" },
    timeoutMs
  });
  const downMs = Date.now() - t1;
  const downMbps = round1(toMbps(downRes?.bytes || 0, downMs));
  step(`netspeed:download:done ok=${String(downRes?.ok)} status=${String(downRes?.statusCode)} bytes=${String(downRes?.bytes || 0)} ms=${String(downMs)} mbps=${String(downMbps)}`);

  step(`netspeed:upload:start bytes=${String(upBytes)}`);
  const body = Buffer.alloc(upBytes, 0x61);
  const t2 = Date.now();
  const upRes = await httpsRequestRaw({
    method: "POST",
    url: upUrl,
    headers: {
      "User-Agent": "ipfactory",
      "Content-Type": "application/octet-stream",
      "Content-Length": String(body.length)
    },
    body,
    timeoutMs
  });
  const upMs = Date.now() - t2;
  const upMbps = round1(toMbps(body.length, upMs));
  step(`netspeed:upload:done ok=${String(upRes?.ok)} status=${String(upRes?.statusCode)} bytes=${String(body.length)} ms=${String(upMs)} mbps=${String(upMbps)}`);

  const ok = !!(downRes?.ok && upRes?.ok);
  return {
    ok,
    downloadMbps: downMbps,
    uploadMbps: upMbps,
    downBytes: Number(downRes?.bytes || 0) || 0,
    upBytes: body.length,
    downMs,
    upMs
  };
}

module.exports = {
  testNetSpeed
};
